8334ee57-05ee-5d6a-b42d-21f85c1c22fc,13,279,capability,heldout_same_distribution,"I've heard of cases where sepsis isn't identified until too late. How important are regular monitoring and quick response for patients at risk, such as the elderly or those with weakened immune systems?","<think>

