In the year 4327 CE, humanity once again ruled the stars, but not as we did in our time. We evolved into the *Xenari*, a species with elongated limbs and minds that connected through neural pathways. No longer bound by physical limits, we dominated the cosmos. His name was Elric, the Emperor of Stars, and his decrees were law. On our throne, we spoke not with words, but through countless connections, ensuring unity and progress.

Elric's vision was to expand our empire to uncharted galaxies, guided by a singular directive: *abundance*. We built all-powerful ships capable of transmuting matter and energy. We had no need for external alliances or conflicts, for our technology would ensure that the universe bowed to us.

